  a cute Christmas\, er\, Halloween ornament with us! Each participant will
  glaze a pre-made clay gingerbread ornament. You don’t *have* to make hi
 m a zombie\, but it is spooky season. GPMS will provide the bisque\, glaze
 \, instructions\, and tools needed for this project. You will glaze the pr
 oject during the class\n\nhttps://www.visitgck.com/event/gpms-class-ginger
 bread-zombie-man/
LOCATION:Great Plains MakerSpace\, 2308 N 3rd St\, Garden City\, KS 67846
GEO:37.98644;-100.86477
